  "ingredients": [
    "4 tomatoes - peeled, seeded and diced",
    "4 cups tomato juice",
    "14 leaves fresh basil",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/toe-zMX1qsAZCXYS_dl0OqkBXP8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13113-Rich-and-Creamy-tomato-basil-soup-DDMFS-Step1-3246-1-6f39a0e007724dc6a10c54e02532e425.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13113/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place tomatoes and juice in a stockpot over medium heat; bring to a simmer. Cook until tomatoes have softened, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/71EetSwPCj-GNlgc0eENbIuskpg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13113-Rich-and-Creamy-tomato-basil-soup-DDMFS-Step2-3284-3a30c49ea9a14e0b813169375b628e4c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13113/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the pot from heat. Add basil leaves to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9_Rr4-FvDTnwopw34u6GipHH-WU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13113-Rich-and-Creamy-tomato-basil-soup-DDMFS-Step3-3285-1-c6b9c15d557d46f28a59b18e164c5404.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13113/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use an immersion blender to purée soup until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bqA2BaGVSg8NgijOeo_b0hPbLVY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13113-Rich-and-Creamy-tomato-basil-soup-DDMFS-Step4-3286-e88df030b141460c873e9924e518597b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13113/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in heavy cream and butter. Cook and stir over medium heat until butter is melted, about 5 minutes. Do not boil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/22P3izDTfjLSL8W6qtYINGD_MNM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13113-Rich-and-Creamy-tomato-basil-soup-DDMFS-Step5-3287-9d9a26ee4ab94e6f9412624c73c94bd4.jpg"
